{"v":4,"catch":"聰明偷竊，快速撤離。記住 —— 蛋糕值得！","desc":"《Thief: Snatch & Run》是一款講究混亂、時機，以及超長手臂的遊戲。從跳舞的人手中偷冰淇淋、越過河岸偷蛋糕、或是在有人哼歌時悄悄從桌上拿走現金 —— 一切都要不著痕跡。\n\n每一關都是一個古怪又充滿創意的謎題，陰影是你的盟友，干擾是你的好朋友，而狗……永遠是個麻煩。有時你會製造停電，有時能騙過警衛，有時你只能勉強帶著戰利品和尊嚴逃跑。","publisher":"Gametry","release":"2025-05-15","genres":["街機","動作","冒險","益智"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/dfa055ae9716314aef3ee8fbd2c462fac098d832da2049318eb05b91dcb9301f.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/8ca8519e24a1f9b7575eccbb0f9c8f403ad98ccdc41e19e65c1eb49ba6170876.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/2622f3df1ebf9ccdb49a3311e81e5012687a70199e962a6df91df5dfed8e884c.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/2e94de07754f16859ffb91b42a5491c025deaa49a0a088b06041f4c10fa5e984.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/9ec8ef1ccf2d5416411e69bbea9946df2707b43f28b33858ed125ba23f1730e7.jpg"],"titleId":"010039302283c000","dlc":[]}